 continue to open their…","Templates let users save reusable query configurations, organize them into categories, pin high-value reports, and reload them later. Template editing is integrated with the same query-state and validation flow used by…","Shows the structured JSON payload for the current query. Useful for debugging filter logic or copying the spec for reuse."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bd89d4d5a230beaa672d3d85b59a594a91f5ef0717f00e4500acedbd9a07697b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.690Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.690Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A static frontend for backend-driven item queries, virtualized results, and Excel export.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Shows the structured JSON payload for the current query. Useful for debugging filter logic or copying the spec for reuse.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The MLP deployment requires sign-in for the complete Query Project; only login and identity checks are public.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"For production use on a Mac with an existing Query Website sign-in, run npm run query:pair.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"bd89d4d5a230beaa672d3d85b59a594a91f5ef0717f00e4500acedbd9a07697b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.691Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-02T21:38:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bt1142msstate/Query/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.693Z","hash":"bd89d4d5a230beaa672d3d85b59a594a91f5ef0717f00e4500acedbd9a07697b","originalByte